        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2125, Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Rustic Modern Rectangular Privacy Pocket Door Set is a great choice for any sliding door where privacy is desired.  The Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a privacy function mortise box, and a pop-out edge pull. The interior plate has a thumbturn and the exterior plate has an emergency release turn. It is made from sandcast bronze. Sandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/rustic-modern-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2126\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/rustic-modern-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2124\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-rustic-modern-rectangular-keyed-entry-pocket-door-emtek-2123\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Rustic Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Projection: 23/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2125-specifications.pdf?v=1704262401\"><b>Emtek 2125 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
